  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Draconic Aspect",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Advanced Race Guide pg. 136",
    "definition_raw": "Source Advanced Race Guide pg. 136\nYou possess some of the qualities of your dragon ancestors.\n\nPrerequisites: Kobold.\n\nBenefit: Your scales take on the color and some of the resistances of one of the chromatic dragons. Choose one of the following chromatic dragon types: black (acid), blue (electricity), green (acid), red (fire), or white (cold). Your scales take on the color of that dragon, and you gain resistance 5 to the dragon color’s corresponding energy type.\n\nSpecial: If you have the dragon-scaled racial trait, your scale color does not change and you gain a +1 natural armor bonus instead.",
    "links_raw": [
      {
